  {
   "id": "d3",
   "narration": {
    "en": "To give somebody a free hand is to allow full freedom to act, and to give somebody a big hand is to applaud. To work hand in hand is to work together, and to have your hands full is to be very busy. Lest is a conjunction meaning to prevent something."
